    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465400/extras/9cacca20338ab117f7cba983f1bc4d5f.poster.avif?t=1753115494\" width=800 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465400/extras/9cacca20338ab117f7cba983f1bc4d5f.webm?t=1753115494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465400/extras/9cacca20338ab117f7cba983f1bc4d5f.mp4?t=1753115494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is the difference between Homaysa and Homaysa: Free To Play?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Homaysa has full game content, features and character skins. Homaysa: Free To Play has <strong>limited</strong> content, features and character skins.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Yeah, but what is Homaysa?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Homaysa, a virtual reality experience for gamers and relaxation seekers alike. This collection of VR game modes and VR experiences offers players the chance to play, chat and relax in a multiplayer environment. With networked physics, Homaysa provides a suitable platform for gaming and simulations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the excitement of VR multiplayer gaming and immerse yourself in a collection of VR experiences and games with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465400/extras/4022c0d9a12c8e589df1f91758098bb0.poster.avif?t=1753115494\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465400/extras/4022c0d9a12c8e589df1f91758098bb0.webp?t=1753115494\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=406 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experiences and Game modes in the new Homaysa:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moon: Experience being on a planet watching earth from another planet while being able to drive a car on that planet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VR Lords: Control your own stone age soldiers to fight against an AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon Crawler horror/puzzle Co-op game mode. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swords Arena: An area where players can fight each others with swords. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mech Football/Soccer: Pilot your own mech and play football with your friends. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax in Alien Planet: An area where players can relax in a night scene on another planet. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indoor Shooting Range: Experience VR shooting with moveable targets and see how good is your aim. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open Shooting Range: VR Shooting in an open area, with almost realistic graphics in VR. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax in Code: Relax or use it for brainstorming in VR, where code will rain on you in a relaxing music.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465400/extras/f181c6a966798accb044a29bfaea0c47.poster.avif?t=1753115494\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465400/extras/f181c6a966798accb044a29bfaea0c47.webm?t=1753115494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465400/extras/f181c6a966798accb044a29bfaea0c47.mp4?t=1753115494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Homaysa community today and experience the next level of virtual reality gaming and relaxation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465400/extras/9cacca20338ab117f7cba983f1bc4d5f.poster.avif?t=1753115494\" width=800 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465400/extras/9cacca20338ab117f7cba983f1bc4d5f.webm?t=1753115494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465400/extras/9cacca20338ab117f7cba983f1bc4d5f.mp4?t=1753115494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is the difference between Homaysa and Homaysa: Free To Play?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Homaysa has full game content, features and character skins. Homaysa: Free To Play has <strong>limited</strong> content, features and character skins.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Yeah, but what is Homaysa?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Homaysa, a virtual reality experience for gamers and relaxation seekers alike. This collection of VR game modes and VR experiences offers players the chance to play, chat and relax in a multiplayer environment. With networked physics, Homaysa provides a suitable platform for gaming and simulations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the excitement of VR multiplayer gaming and immerse yourself in a collection of VR experiences and games with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465400/extras/4022c0d9a12c8e589df1f91758098bb0.poster.avif?t=1753115494\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465400/extras/4022c0d9a12c8e589df1f91758098bb0.webp?t=1753115494\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=406 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experiences and Game modes in the new Homaysa:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moon: Experience being on a planet watching earth from another planet while being able to drive a car on that planet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VR Lords: Control your own stone age soldiers to fight against an AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon Crawler horror/puzzle Co-op game mode. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swords Arena: An area where players can fight each others with swords. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mech Football/Soccer: Pilot your own mech and play football with your friends. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax in Alien Planet: An area where players can relax in a night scene on another planet. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indoor Shooting Range: Experience VR shooting with moveable targets and see how good is your aim. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open Shooting Range: VR Shooting in an open area, with almost realistic graphics in VR. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax in Code: Relax or use it for brainstorming in VR, where code will rain on you in a relaxing music.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465400/extras/f181c6a966798accb044a29bfaea0c47.poster.avif?t=1753115494\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465400/extras/f181c6a966798accb044a29bfaea0c47.webm?t=1753115494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465400/extras/f181c6a966798accb044a29bfaea0c47.mp4?t=1753115494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Homaysa community today and experience the next level of virtual reality gaming and relaxation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
